        "reviewer_name": "Babbbs",
        "review_title": "Works for irrigation wire",
        "rating": 5,
        "review_text": "I bought this because I upgraded to a smart irrigation control. It turns out that the original wires for each of the zones did not reach the area where they needed to plug in. I had to \"splice\" each wire to its respective color (by twisting with a cap) and then run to the new irrigation control. It worked. I was grateful to be able to buy a small quantity of wire that had the variety of colors I needed.\nRead more",
